DESCRIPTION:Conference title: ACM SIGGRAPH Annual Conference\nWebsite: http
 s://s2027.siggraph.org/\nSource URL: https://s2027.siggraph.org/program/t
 echnical-papers/\nLocation: Anaheim\, California\, USA\nTopics: Computer 
 Graphics & Visualization\, Machine Learning\, Computer Vision & Pattern R
 ecognition\nSize: XXL\nSubmission type: Technical papers / conference and
  ACM TOG tracks\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-28\nNo
 tes: The 2027 site confirms the Anaheim Convention Center\, Aug 8-12\, 20
 27. Its Technical Papers page (updated 2026-09-30) gives Jan 21/28/29\, 2
 027 at 22:00 UTC\; the older Submit page still says TBA and no exact open
 ing is published. The upload step is not a new paper route. Not SIGGRAPH 
