 ate.\nScope: Computer graphics and interactive techniques\, centered on r
 endering\, geometric modeling\, animation\, physical simulation\, imaging
 \, visualization\, and immersive visual experiences. Generative AI and ma
 chine learning are relevant when they advance visual computing\, such as 
 neural rendering and learned animation. Technical papers use integrated c
 onference and ACM TOG journal tracks\; this profile does not describe SIG
 GRAPH Asia or all of AI.\nAdditional topics: Deep Representation Learning
 \, Human-AI Interaction & Deployment\nScope sources (2026): https://s2026
 .siggraph.org/program/technical-papers/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
